{"overview":"Thwarted by his despotic uncle from continuing his love affair, a young man's thoughts turn dark as he dwells on ways to deal with his uncle. Increasingly convinced that murder is merely a natural part of life, he kills his uncle and hides the body. However, the man's conscience awakens; paranoia sets in and nightmarish visions begin to haunt him.","tagline":"The criminal haunted by tortures of the mind","cast":[{"n":"Henry B. Walthall","c":"The Nephew","p":"/v8G0OotHtSpp4iB2CBwWl9LFVkW.jpg","q":"Q661678"},{"n":"Spottiswoode Aitken","c":"The Uncle","p":"/oxtS8L2eigbXalqO9XDTPlz8YQA.jpg","q":"Q1230515"},{"n":"Blanche Sweet","c":"The Sweetheart","p":"/xlcBzlENawXKPIQnpORlUCNkHmj.jpg","q":"Q267718"},{"n":"George Siegmann","c":"The Italian","p":"/ekmTjMAXd71x4KSrFVfkc90vzDP.jpg","q":"Q745994"},{"n":"Ralph Lewis","c":"The Detective","p":"/hcZEuTJlj57Eapbtp103IMq7DVP.jpg","q":"Q684079"},{"n":"Mae Marsh","c":"The Maid","p":"/1PDFSBQCwJ1yteuffEJgwSrAVra.jpg","q":"Q153332"},{"n":"Robert Harron","c":"The Grocery Boy","p":"/8uqveFAwItcd5Ty2OEMPM37bbZb.jpg","q":"Q1344716"},{"n":"George Beranger","c":"","p":"/ila7m49FIrwRvaEn8LK6riEY4ox.jpg","q":"Q3101419"},{"n":"Donald Crisp","c":"","p":"/MEPq09iLEwJVrxw1T97qOILhk6.jpg","q":"Q367073"},{"n":"Josephine Crowell","c":"The Sweetheart's Mother (uncredited)","p":"/tWAM1i3JvmtUQ3BnKXo8mhHknN1.jpg","q":"Q3138866"}],"country":["United States"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Avenging_Conscience","qid":"Q2455358","rel":{"US":{"d":"1914-08-02","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/cEAwb6j7NUlAoqirygTPlR53iIx.jpg","/caHOjLqztuDdmJhVjamfqNpQPjR.jpg"]}